  <div class="dashboard-container">
    <div class="welcome-section">
      <h1 class="welcome-title">Welcome to Image Metadata Management System</h1>
      <p style="font-size: large;">The Image Metadata
        Management System is
        a one-stop portal for
        handling imaging
        project metadata for
        tracking of projects and
        safekeeping of
        important image-related information. </p>

      <h2>Quick Start Guide:</h2>
      <p style="font-size: x-large;">

        Admins please use your “Admin” role accounts only for system administration tasks.
        For other task, please use your “Project Owner” or “Photographer” role accounts.
        Create them if you have not.
        <br>


        Download the Mandatory bulk metadata extraction tool at
        <img src="/images/image-metadata-management.png" alt="Image Metadata Management Button"> page from the sidebar.
        The download button on the top panel of buttons

        <br>
        <img src="/images/download-extraction-tool.png" alt="Location of the button in the page"
          style="width:600px;height:auto;">

        <br>
        Read the full instructions on how to use the tool.
        <br>
        <br>

        To register a new project, please click on <img src="/images/project-managment-link.png"
          alt="Project Managment Button"> on the sidebar to the left and then click "Add Project".
        <br>
        To upload image metadata (only after registering related project), please click on <img
          src="/images/image-metadata-management.png" alt="Image Metadata Management Button"> on the sidebar on the
        left and then click on "Upload Bulk Metadata"
        <br>
      </p>
      <p>You can create “photographer” accounts for your staff during the creation or editing of any projects. Please
        remember to remind them to change their passwords as soon as possible for account security. </p>
      <h2>Full Instructions</h2>

